// fx sqrt digits -- one step of the base-4 recurrence, and the wide fixup.
//
// Split out from sqrt.id because the step is two writes and the decision around
// it is two more actions: a block holds three, so the taken branch has to be its
// own function. The order inside fx_sqtake matters -- slot 0 is updated using the
// old slot 1, so the remainder must be written before the root is.

